form(action='#')
    h2.a-subtitle COUNTER Reports July 2010 &ndash; Present

    h3.f-h6.a-emphasis Delivery Via Email

    p.m-deflist__intro.f-body--sm
        | NEJM.org usage statistics are provided in COUNTER Release 4 format. Reports are available 2&ndash;14 days after the close of eatch month (for previous month&apos;s data) via email delivery.

    h4.a-subtitle.a-subtitle--alt.a-subtitle--subtle 1. Select Time

    .m-deflist
        dl.m-deflist__dl
            dt
                span.a-form-radio
                    input#yearOnlyRadioOption(type='radio', name='yearOnly', value='true', checked='')

                    label(for='yearOnlyRadioOption') Select year

            dd
                .m-deflist__select
                    span.a-form-select
                        select#year.year(name='year')
                            option(value='2017') 2017

                            option(value='2016') 2016

                            option(value='2015') 2015

                            option(value='2014') 2014

                            option(value='2013') 2013

                            option(value='2012') 2012

                            option(value='2011') 2011

                            option(value='2010') 2010

        dl.m-deflist__dl.m-deflist__dl--sep
            dt
                span.a-form-radio
                    input#monthRange(type='radio', name='yearOnly', value='false')

                    label(for='monthRange') Select Range

            dd
                label.m-deflist__select-label(for='startMonthId') From

                .m-deflist__select
                    span.a-form-select
                        select#startMonthId.year(name='startMonth')
                            option(value='1') January

                            option(value='2') February

                            option(value='3') March

                            option(value='4') April

                            option(value='5') May

                            option(value='6') June

                            option(value='7') July

                            option(value='8') August

                            option(value='9') September

                            option(value='10') October

                            option(value='11') November

                            option(value='12') December

                .m-deflist__select
                    span.a-form-select
                        select#startYear.year(name='startYear')
                            option(value='2017') 2017

                            option(value='2016') 2016

                            option(value='2015') 2015

                            option(value='2014') 2014

                            option(value='2013') 2013

                            option(value='2012') 2012

                            option(value='2011') 2011

                            option(value='2010') 2010

                label.m-deflist__select-label(for='endMonthId') To

                .m-deflist__select
                    span.a-form-select
                        select#endMonthId.year(name='endMonth')
                            option(value='1') January

                            option(value='2') February

                            option(value='3') March

                            option(value='4') April

                            option(value='5') May

                            option(value='6') June

                            option(value='7') July

                            option(value='8') August

                            option(value='9') September

                            option(value='10') October

                            option(value='11') November

                            option(value='12') December

                .m-deflist__select
                    span.a-form-select
                        select#endYear.year(name='endYear')
                            option(value='2017') 2017

                            option(value='2016') 2016

                            option(value='2015') 2015

                            option(value='2014') 2014

                            option(value='2013') 2013

                            option(value='2012') 2012

                            option(value='2011') 2011

                            option(value='2010') 2010

    h4.a-subtitle.a-subtitle--alt.a-subtitle--subtle 2. Select Reports

    .m-deflist
        ul.m-deflist__ul.m-deflist__ul--spaced
            li
                span.a-form-checkbox
                    input#counterIdsAll(type='checkbox', name='counterIdsAll', value='all', data-behavior='SelectAllCheckboxes', data-checkboxes='counterIds')

                    label(for='counterIdsAll')
                        strong Select all reports

            li
                span.a-form-checkbox
                    input#counterIdsjournal1(type='checkbox', name='counterIds', value='journal1')

                    label(for='counterIdsjournal1')
                        strong Journal Report 1
                        br
                        |                   Number of Successful Full-Text Article Requests by Month and Journal

            li
                span.a-form-checkbox
                    input#counterIdsjournal1GOA(type='checkbox', name='counterIds', value='journal1GOA')

                    label(for='counterIdsjournal1GOA')
                        strong Journal Report 1 GOA
                        br
                        |                   Number of Successful Gold Open Access Full-Text Article Requests by Month and Journal

            li
                span.a-form-checkbox
                    input#counterIdsjournal1a(type='checkbox', name='counterIds', value='journal1a')

                    label(for='counterIdsjournal1a')
                        strong Journal Report 1a
                        br
                        |                   Number of Successful Full-Text Article Requests from an Archive by Month and Journal

            li
                span.a-form-checkbox
                    input#counterIdsjournal2(type='checkbox', name='counterIds', value='journal2')

                    label(for='counterIdsjournal2')
                        strong Journal Report 2
                        br
                        |                   Turnaways by Month and Journal

        ul.m-deflist__ul.m-deflist__ul--spaced
            li
                span.a-form-checkbox
                    input#counterIdsjournal3(type='checkbox', name='counterIds', value='journal3')

                    label(for='counterIdsjournal3')
                        strong Journal Report 3
                        br
                        |                   Number of Successful Item Requests and Turnaways by Month, Journal and Page Type

            li
                span.a-form-checkbox
                    input#counterIdsjournal5(type='checkbox', name='counterIds', value='journal5')

                    label(for='counterIdsjournal5')
                        strong Journal Report 5
                        br
                        |                   Number of Successful Full-Text Article Requests by Year-of-Publication (YOP) and Journal

            li
                span.a-form-checkbox
                    input#counterIdsplatform1(type='checkbox', name='counterIds', value='platform1')

                    label(for='counterIdsplatform1')
                        strong Platform Report 1
                        br
                        |                   Total Searches, Result Clicks and Record Views by Month and Platform

            li
                span.a-form-checkbox
                    input#counterIdsconsortium1(type='checkbox', name='counterIds', value='consortium1')

                    label(for='counterIdsconsortium1')
                        strong Consortium Report 1
                        br
                        |                   Number of successful full-text journal article or book chapter requests by month

    h4.a-subtitle.a-subtitle--alt.a-subtitle--subtle 3. Select File Formats

    .m-deflist
        dl.m-deflist__dl
            dt Select the file format(s) you would like the report(s) to be in.

            dd
                span.a-form-checkbox
                    input#format_XML(type='checkbox', value='xml', name='format')

                    label(for='format_XML') XML

                span.a-form-checkbox
                    input#format_HTML(type='checkbox', value='html', name='format', checked='')

                    label(for='format_HTML') HTML

                span.a-form-checkbox
                    input#format_tsv(type='checkbox', value='tsv', name='format')

                    label(for='format_tsv') Tab Deliminated

    h4.a-subtitle.a-subtitle--alt.a-subtitle--subtle 4. Email Reports

    p.m-deflist__intro.f-body--sm
        | The reports you have selected will be sent to you automatically when you press submit. Designate additional recipients using the field below.

    .m-deflist
        dl.m-deflist__dl
            dt
                label(for='emailAddresses') Email Address(es)

            dd
                textarea(name='emailAddresses', rows='4') isaac@area17.com

                em.m-deflist__notes Separate multiple email addresses with a comma.

    .m-deflist__action
        p.f-ui
            a(href='/templates/help-with-IP-address.php', data-behavior='OpenInModal') Help with Usage Reports

        button.a-btn(type='submit')
            | Submit
            svg.icon--arrow(aria-hidden='true')
                use(xmlns:xlink='http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink', xlink:href='#icon--arrow')

    h2.a-subtitle Report Retrieval Via SUSHI

    p.m-deflist__intro.f-body--sm
        | If your organization operates a SUSHI client, you may use it to retrieve COUNTER reports from this platform.

    .m-deflist
        dl.m-deflist__dl
            dt Host SUSHI request URL

            dd http://www.nejm.org/api/soap/analytics/SushiService

            dt User Requestor ID

            dd isaac@area17.com

            dt User CustomerReference ID

            dd IP00007

    .m-deflist__action
        p.f-ui
            a(href='/templates/help-with-sushi.php', data-behavior='OpenInModal') Help with SUSHI

h2.a-subtitle Reports January 2005 &ndash; June 2010

p.m-deflist__intro.f-body--sm
    | Reports from 2005 to June 2010 are available only in tab-delimited format. The .zip file(s) below contain one tab delimited file for each year of data.

.m-deflist
    dl.m-deflist__dl
        dt Package of NEJM Reports

        dd
            a(href='zip/IP00007.zip', download='') IP00007.zip

.m-deflist__action
    p.f-ui
        a(href='/templates/help-with-IP-address.php', data-behavior='OpenInModal') Help with Older Reports

h2.a-subtitle Email Notifications

form(action='#')
    .m-deflist
        span.a-form-checkbox
            input#counterEnabled(type='checkbox', name='counterEnabled', value='true')

            label(for='counterEnabled')
                | Receive an email notification when COUNTER usage data for the current month has been processed and is ready for reporting.

    .m-deflist__action.m-deflist__action--closer
        button.a-btn.a-btn--simple(type='submit') Save Changes
